    "user_request_original": "Optimize a 20-layer alternating HfO2/SiO2 multilayer stack on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Layer sequence: HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2 (20 finite layers total). Initialize thicknesses at [110, 56, 117, 58, 122, 61, 130, 58, 149, 59, 154, 65, 132, 113, 115, 131, 121, 111, 59, 58] nm based on round-1 best candidate. Set optimization bounds to ±8 nm around each initial value. Use gradient-based thickness optimizer with reduced mutation step size. Evaluate spectral performance at normal incidence across 300-450 nm (maximize reflectance) and 1000-1700 nm (maximize transmittance). Apply ±5% relative thickness tolerance for robustness analysis. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 300-450 nm, 1000-1700 nm. soft objectives: high transmission in 1000-1700 nm; high reflection in 300-450 nm. behaviors to suppress or avoid: reflection in 1000-1700 nm; transmission in 300-450 nm. manufacturing constraints: Maximum total layer count of 30.",
